This personal repository rebuilds the legacy HttpSource/API 1.4 module at
commit d12e3b8a1eb5d7e5c7230f5b5b5854ba625a97dd, with versionCode incremented
from 1 to 3. Version 1.4.3 replaces Android PdfRenderer/ParcelFileDescriptor and
filesystem caching with a portable image-only PDF extractor and a bounded
in-memory chapter cache. The final JAR and APK use this repository's personal
signing certificate.

Apache PDFBox and FontBox 2.0.37, Copyright The Apache Software Foundation.
Apache Commons Logging 1.2, Copyright The Apache Software Foundation.
Dependency licenses and notices are preserved in source/mangadash/assets/licenses/
and in the published packages. The PDFBox FilterFactory has been modified to
avoid initializing AWT/ImageIO-dependent codecs; the modification is provided
in source/headless-pdfbox/FilterFactory.java. Image extraction code is new.

Repository scripts, tests, configuration, indexes, and workflows are also
